SUMMARY:NEAT WALKS Ghosts of Historic Toronto
DESCRIPTION:NEATWalks takes you on a pre-Halloween haunted tour. \nBe prepared to get scared! and dress for the weather! This is an outdoor tour and will take place rain or shine. \nMeeting point: Princes’ Gates at Exhibition Place. \nGetting there by public transit (TTC): Take the 509 or 511 streetcar\, or the 29C bus\, to reach the meeting point. \nWho is it for:\nNewcomers to Canada with Permanent Resident or Convention Refugee status. \nTo register\, or for more information\, contact Rubeen at rchauhan@culturelink.ca or 437-249-7103
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/neat-walks-ghosts-of-historic-toronto/
LOCATION:Princes’ Gates\, 11 Princes' Blvd\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6K 3C3\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Neat-Walks-Web-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
