SUMMARY:NEAT Walks Festival of Lights at Nathan Phillips Square
DESCRIPTION:Neat walks for newcomers to explore and appreciate Toronto! \n\nA family friendly event\nExplore the cultural explosion of cuisine\, music\, revelry and entertainment\, including fireworks\n\n\nRain or shine\, see you there! \nMeeting point: By the corner of Queen and Bay\, just outside the square. \nWho is for: Permanent residents and Convention refugees. \nTo register: For new participants please fill this form. \n                      For returning participants please message to reserve your spot. \n                      For more details email Rubeen Chauhan at rchauhan@culturelink.ca or 437-249-71o3
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/neat-walks-festival-of-lights-at-nathan-phillips-square/
LOCATION:Nathan Phillips Square\, 100 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5H 2N1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Neat-Walks-Web-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
