SUMMARY:Seniors wellness day
DESCRIPTION:Come relax\, recharge\, and connect with others in a welcoming environment. \nWhat to expect: \n\nBreathing techniques and how to relax\nGentle chair massage\nSnacks will be provided\n\nTo register please contact: \nAndrea at 437-688-1248
