UID:10003332-1793298600-1793307600@www.culturelink.ca
SUMMARY:NEAT Walks Evening Ghost Tour
DESCRIPTION:Neat Walks for newcomers to explore and appreciate Toronto! \n\nNight time tour of the legislative building\nLearn about the folklore and unexplained happenings\nBe ready for the airport style security check at the start of the tour\nDress for the weather\, includes a 10-minutes outdoor walk to the tour place and back\n\nMeeting Point: Inside TTC Queen’s park subway station( Yonge/Bloor Line) and then head to the Legislative Building together! \nWho is for: Permanent residents and Convention refugees. \nTo register: For new participants fill out this form. \nFor returning participants reserve your spot via text. \nFor more details email Rubeen Chauhan at rchauhan@culturelink.ca or 437-249-7103 \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/neat-walks-evening-ghost-tour/
LOCATION:Legislative Assembly of Ontario\, 111 Wellesley Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M7A 1A2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Neat-Walks-Web-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
