SUMMARY:National Ballet of Canada
DESCRIPTION:The National Ballet of Canada is celebrating its 75th anniversary with John Cranko’s Romeo and Juliet. \nWe invite you to enjoy this timeless piece with other newcomers.\nRunning time: 2 hours and 45 minutes\, including 2 intermissions \nRegister now! Only 30 seats available. \nYou must be: \n\nPermanent Resident\, Convention Refugee or Protected Person\nat least 13 years old\n\nVenue details will be share with registered participants. \nFor more information\, contact Karen kau-yeung@culturelink.ca or Victor at vgomes@culturelink.ca. \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/national-ballet-of-canada/
CATEGORIES:Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Families-Mentorship-and-Networking-Building-Connections-CultureLink-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
