SUMMARY:Cybersecurity Training Information Session
DESCRIPTION:Learn about our Cybersecurity Training Program\, and how it can help you advance your career in Canada. \nAttending an information session is the first step before applying for the program.  \nThis session is presented in partnership with ACHEV. \nFor more information\, please contact Aqeela at asaddiqui@culturelink.ca.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/cybersecurity-training-information-session-2026-11-06/
